{"vid":"HsT-lvQFczU","source":"HsT-lvQFczU.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"hey welcome to the shop you know over"},{"t":1.7,"txt":"the years I've built several different"},{"t":3,"txt":"carts for machines welding machine car"},{"t":5.3,"txt":"to cart for my bender and then some"},{"t":7.5,"txt":"others the nice thing about building"},{"t":9,"txt":"your own is you can make it just the way"},{"t":10.7,"txt":"you want for whatever equipment you're"},{"t":12.2,"txt":"using I built this little cart today"},{"t":14.3,"txt":"that has a hopper and a bucket to catch"},{"t":17.5,"txt":"some of the chips from my chop saw so"},{"t":19.4,"txt":"I'm going to show you how I built that"},{"t":20.6,"txt":"but along the way I'll show you a simple"},{"t":22.1,"txt":"three-step process to be able to build"},{"t":24.4,"txt":"carts really simply for whatever kind of"},{"t":26.4,"txt":"machines you have let's go ahead and get"},{"t":28.1,"txt":"started in order to build this I picked"},{"t":30.2,"txt":"up some inch and a quarter or 30"},{"t":31.6,"txt":"millimeter square tubing and Sheet Metal"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"all in 16 gauge I've cut everything to"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"size but I'm going to walk through in a"},{"t":38.5,"txt":"four-step process like I have laid out"},{"t":40.6,"txt":"here the different pieces that you'll"},{"t":42.5,"txt":"need so you'll know what size to cut"},{"t":43.7,"txt":"them to"},{"t":44.6,"txt":"the first part I need is a rectangle for"},{"t":46.7,"txt":"the top of the frame and I'm going to go"},{"t":48.2,"txt":"ahead and measure the chop saw that's"},{"t":50.5,"txt":"going to sit on here to be able to build"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"that rectangle and cut all my miters I'm"},{"t":55.4,"txt":"using the same chop saw it's a unique"},{"t":57.4,"txt":"one from Evolution power tools they just"},{"t":59.3,"txt":"came out with and sent to me it's a chop"},{"t":62.2,"txt":"saw head on a heavy duty miter saw body"},{"t":64.4,"txt":"now with the pieces cut here for this"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"top rectangle I've created a couple of"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"references on my fixture table if you"},{"t":71.2,"txt":"don't have a fixture table you can use a"},{"t":73.3,"txt":"fabrication square like this or even"},{"t":75.7,"txt":"just a speed square I've built a lot of"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"really nice frames using nothing but"},{"t":80.5,"txt":"speed square so it works fine once you"},{"t":83,"txt":"have one Corner established one of the"},{"t":84.5,"txt":"problems is that these miters can slide"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"around so marking the center is a really"},{"t":89,"txt":"good thing to do to be able to line"},{"t":90.7,"txt":"everything up I'm just using a cheap set"},{"t":93.1,"txt":"of calipers it's not great for the"},{"t":94.4,"txt":"calipers but if you keep a cheap pair"},{"t":95.9,"txt":"around just for this it works fine then"},{"t":98.2,"txt":"I can line up the center marks and"},{"t":100.9,"txt":"everything aligns really well I'm going"},{"t":103.6,"txt":"to clamp it all down which really will"},{"t":106,"txt":"help with Distortion and make any final"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"adjustments so that everything is"},{"t":109.3,"txt":"parallel and measure corner to corner to"},{"t":111.8,"txt":"make sure it's square and everything's"},{"t":113.9,"txt":"looking really good"},{"t":121.1,"txt":"to avoid Distortion I'm going to start"},{"t":122.8,"txt":"by welding the faces from the inside to"},{"t":124.7,"txt":"the outside after both faces I can go"},{"t":127.4,"txt":"ahead and weld the outside corners"},{"t":129.4,"txt":"saving the inner fillet welds for last"},{"t":131.7,"txt":"I'm going to make the lower rectangle a"},{"t":133.7,"txt":"little bit smaller to clear this portion"},{"t":135.5,"txt":"of the foundation and let it sit against"},{"t":137,"txt":"the walls on my welding cart I made the"},{"t":139.7,"txt":"bottom rectangle larger to hold the"},{"t":141.2,"txt":"cylinders and I made it larger on the"},{"t":143.9,"txt":"Bender card as well so it's pretty"},{"t":145.4,"txt":"common to have them different sizes I"},{"t":147.9,"txt":"put the lower rectangle together in the"},{"t":149.5,"txt":"same way and ground the corners to allow"},{"t":152.2,"txt":"my uprights to be able to sit flat next"},{"t":154.9,"txt":"I just have four pieces to sit in the"},{"t":156.7,"txt":"corners as you'd imagine that they would"},{"t":158.4,"txt":"now it's important to get it straight in"},{"t":161.2,"txt":"two different directions one way to do"},{"t":162.9,"txt":"this is to use a speed square and Tack"},{"t":165.8,"txt":"and then switch and do the other"},{"t":167.6,"txt":"direction since I have a fixture table"},{"t":170.3,"txt":"with this upright reference I'm just"},{"t":172.1,"txt":"going to use that for each of them clamp"},{"t":174.5,"txt":"it in place and get some tack welds"},{"t":176.5,"txt":"before I flip it over and put it onto"},{"t":179.6,"txt":"the top"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"I like how things are lining up here I'm"},{"t":183,"txt":"going to start off by putting a single"},{"t":184.7,"txt":"tack at each of the front corners and"},{"t":188.4,"txt":"after I have both front Corners tacked"},{"t":191.3,"txt":"together I can go ahead and measure to"},{"t":194.4,"txt":"the back to make sure that this is going"},{"t":197.2,"txt":"to sit parallel and with that tacked in"},{"t":200.6,"txt":"place on both sides I can double check"},{"t":202.7,"txt":"everything for square and it's looking"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"really good so I'll add some additional"},{"t":206.6,"txt":"tags before welding it out"},{"t":213.8,"txt":"the basic frame is built now and it's"},{"t":215.5,"txt":"time to turn attention to casters there"},{"t":217.4,"txt":"are several different types of casters"},{"t":218.8,"txt":"you can use some with top plates to just"},{"t":220.6,"txt":"weld them on or on a plate but I like"},{"t":222.5,"txt":"these because not only do they lock the"},{"t":224.4,"txt":"rotation of the wheel they also lock the"},{"t":226.4,"txt":"swivel portion using that tooth wheel"},{"t":228.3,"txt":"underneath so I'm going to cut some"},{"t":230.9,"txt":"angle braces here to hold them in place"},{"t":233.9,"txt":"and kind of share that load and just"},{"t":236,"txt":"drill and tap a few holes to be able to"},{"t":240.1,"txt":"thread them into"},{"t":242.3,"txt":"after a quick deburr I can go ahead and"},{"t":245.3,"txt":"set them in place just like you'd"},{"t":247.4,"txt":"imagine this is going to be pretty good"},{"t":249.2,"txt":"to share the load but also to allow the"},{"t":252.3,"txt":"Caster to swivel out without sticking"},{"t":254.2,"txt":"out so far as it would if I were to put"},{"t":256,"txt":"it right underneath the corner so I like"},{"t":258.2,"txt":"how this is fitting together time to"},{"t":259.9,"txt":"weld it out"},{"t":268.1,"txt":"well everything rolls smoothly and seems"},{"t":270.4,"txt":"pretty nice and square now I'm going to"},{"t":272.6,"txt":"go ahead and turn my attention to the"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"hopper to catch some of the chips coming"},{"t":278.2,"txt":"down off the bottom here this has been a"},{"t":280.7,"txt":"problem with any chop saw that I've had"},{"t":282.3,"txt":"I'm trying to collect those and I know"},{"t":284.6,"txt":"this won't work 100 but it should be"},{"t":286.9,"txt":"pretty good now I could probably have"},{"t":289.8,"txt":"just as quickly cut these out by hand"},{"t":291.6,"txt":"using a straight edge as programming"},{"t":293.7,"txt":"them on the CNC but I just did it this"},{"t":296.2,"txt":"way a quick deburr of the dross from the"},{"t":299.8,"txt":"plasma cutting is always a good idea"},{"t":301.5,"txt":"before welding even though I'm going to"},{"t":302.9,"txt":"be MIG welding it here and it's not"},{"t":305,"txt":"quite as particular as if I were to TIG"},{"t":306.8,"txt":"weld these corners"},{"t":308.6,"txt":"it's really a bit of uh origami here to"},{"t":311.8,"txt":"get things to fit together because you"},{"t":313.1,"txt":"have the same problem whenever you build"},{"t":314.5,"txt":"a shape like this you have with that"},{"t":316,"txt":"frame where things can slide side to"},{"t":318.4,"txt":"side so I just like to get one corner"},{"t":320.7,"txt":"lined up up there at the top especially"},{"t":322.6,"txt":"since I know these all fit together"},{"t":324.2,"txt":"pretty well after a little bit of"},{"t":327.1,"txt":"working with it it all fit together"},{"t":329,"txt":"nicely and I think I'll be able to weld"},{"t":331.7,"txt":"it out without too much trouble"},{"t":335,"txt":"I'm just welding downhill using a back"},{"t":337.6,"txt":"stitch technique where I start a little"},{"t":340.1,"txt":"ways from the end and then work my way"},{"t":343.1,"txt":"up this helps to avoid Distortion and"},{"t":345.7,"txt":"keep things nice and square as I"},{"t":349.1,"txt":"assemble this and it came out pretty"},{"t":351.2,"txt":"well I'm just going to grind the corners"},{"t":353.2,"txt":"down a little bit for a nice smooth"},{"t":354.9,"txt":"appearance before setting it in place"},{"t":357.2,"txt":"and it turns out that I'll need a"},{"t":359.5,"txt":"clearance those Corners just a little"},{"t":361.6,"txt":"bit so that it can sit down where I want"},{"t":364.1,"txt":"it to I just do that with a grinder"},{"t":367.9,"txt":"foreign"},{"t":374,"txt":"happy with how this is sitting so far"},{"t":376.7,"txt":"now I just need a way to catch all the"},{"t":378.8,"txt":"chips that come down out of this big"},{"t":380.5,"txt":"funnel rather than fabricating some kind"},{"t":383.1,"txt":"of metal box like I was originally"},{"t":384.5,"txt":"planning I just need a way to hold a"},{"t":386.2,"txt":"bucket in place I'm cutting a couple"},{"t":388.4,"txt":"cross members out of some one inch or 25"},{"t":390.4,"txt":"millimeter square tubing that I had"},{"t":392,"txt":"laying around and then I'm going to weld"},{"t":395.6,"txt":"on some little pieces of round bar to"},{"t":398.5,"txt":"act as stops and hold the bucket 